// LEVEL: 1
// DEPENDENCE: ./src
// Regression: -h documents '-e <v1:v2:...>' colon separated exclusion rules
// (eg: ./cjlint -f fileDir -e fileDir/a/:fileDir/b/*.cj). Colon separated
// rules must be split and honored: a.cj and sub/ excluded, only test_x.cj
// reported. NOTE: the manual documents space separated rules instead; this
// case pins the -h behavior until docs/tool are aligned.
// EXEC-PIPE: %lint -f ./src -e a.cj:sub/ -c %cangjieDir/tools -m %cangjieDir 2>&1 | compare %f
// ASSERT: regex .*test_x\.cj:10:5:.*warning.*G\.VAR\.01: Prefer immutable variables when the value of the variable 'count' does not change\.
// ASSERT: regex-not .*[/\\]a\.cj:10:5.*
// ASSERT: regex-not .*sub[/\\]c\.cj:10:5.*
